    "projectDescriptionEn": "<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Expansion of the capacity of Sulphonated Naphthalene Formaldehyde (SNF), a compound that is widely used as a concrete admixture, by 60k tpa.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Upon completion of this project,&nbsp;the total operating capacity of the company would be around 223k tpa of SNF.<o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n",
